📘 Smart Attendance System

A modern, responsive Smart Attendance Management System developed for educational institutions. The system provides separate dashboards for Students and Faculty, allowing efficient attendance management, real-time statistics, and downloadable attendance reports.

🌐 Live Demo

🔗 Website: https://dileepkumarpallapu.github.io/Smart-Attendance-System/

